msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Minori「Oh man, talking to you is fun,＿Takasu-kun! You lost your memory,＿but not your sense of humor!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Vaya, hablar contigo es divertido,＿Takasu-kun! ¡Perdiste la memoria,＿pero no el sentido del humor!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Was our conversation that funny? I'm＿glad she's enjoying it though......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Tan graciosa fue nuestra charla?＿Aunque me alegra que la disfrute......）」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, I know! You just reminded me......」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ah, ya sé! Me acabas de recordar......」"

msgid "Minori「You can have this photo.」"
msgstr "Minori「Puedes quedarte con esta foto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Photo......? O-Oh!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Foto......? ¡A-Ah!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That monster is running!　......Wait,＿that's me!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Ese monstruo está＿corriendo!　......¡Espera, ese soy yo!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Kushieda is there too...... Maybe it's＿from the sports festival or＿something......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Kushieda también está ahí......＿¿Tal vez sea del festival deportivo＿o algo así......?）」"

msgid "Minori「Does this photo remind you of＿anything?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Esta foto te recuerda algo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Sorry, no.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Lo siento, no.」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, no worries. This photo is from the＿Culture Festival, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ah, no pasa nada. Esta foto es＿del Festival Cultural, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Culture Festival?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Festival Cultural?」"

msgid "Minori「Yup. It's just one scene from that＿event.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sip. Es solo una escena de ese evento.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Man, I look terrifying, don't I?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Caray, me veo aterrador, ¿no?」"

msgid "Minori「No you don't! The Takasu-kun in this＿picture was giving it his best. I don't＿see anything terrifying about that.」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Claro que no! El Takasu-kun de esta＿foto estaba dando lo mejor de sí. No＿veo nada de aterrador en eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh...... Thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah...... Gracias.」"

msgid "Minori「......Whoops, I got a little too serious＿there. Hehehe.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Uy, me puse demasiado＿seria. Jejeje.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But why do you have this photo?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Pero por qué tienes esta foto?」"

msgid "Minori「Well, I collect pictures of me, ya know.」"
msgstr "Minori「Bueno, colecciono fotos mías, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I mean, why do you have it right now?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Digo que por qué la llevas ahora.」"

msgid "Minori「Ohhh, my bad. I thought it would be＿good to have on hand when I tell＿Grandma about my classmates, see.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ahhh, perdón. Pensé que sería bueno＿tenerla a mano para contarle a mi abuela＿sobre mis compañeros, ¿ves?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha...... You were going to show this＿pic to your granny, Kushieda?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué...... ¿Ibas a mostrarle esta＿foto a tu abuelita, Kushieda?」"

msgid "Minori「That was the plan, but I'll give it to you,＿Takasu-kun. It might give you an＿opportunity to remember something!」"
msgstr "Minori「Ese era el plan, pero te la doy a＿ti, Takasu-kun. ¡Quizá te dé la＿oportunidad de recordar algo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I'm grateful, then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Te lo agradezco, entonces.」"

msgid "Minori「Yup yup. Nooow then, reckon I should＿get moving～」"
msgstr "Minori「Sip, sip. Bueeeno, creo que＿ya debería irme yendo～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay. Sorry for holding you up.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien. Perdón por entretenerte.」"

msgid "Minori「Don't you worry. Let us meet again,＿Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Minori「No te preocupes. Volvamos＿a vernos, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Take care.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cuídate.」"

msgid "Minori「Will dooo!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Eso harééé!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Oh, I should have asked her when＿she'll be back.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Ah, debí preguntarle＿cuándo volverá.）」"
